#: ../../library/omv.apds9960.rst:209
msgid "LED drive, gain, and boost"
msgstr "LED-virta, vahvistus ja tehostus"

#: ../../library/omv.apds9960.rst:213
msgid ""
"Return the LED drive strength used for proximity and ALS. Encoded as one of "
"the ``APDS9960_LED_DRIVE_*`` values (0 = 100 mA, 1 = 50 mA, 2 = 25 mA, 3 = "
"12.5 mA)."
msgstr ""
"Palauta läheisyyteen ja ALS:ään käytetty LED-virran voimakkuus. Koodattu "
"yhtenä ``APDS9960_LED_DRIVE_*`` -arvoista (0 = 100 mA, 1 = 50 mA, 2 = 25 mA,"
" 3 = 12,5 mA)."

#: ../../library/omv.apds9960.rst:219
msgid ""
"Set the LED drive strength used for proximity and ALS. ``drive`` is one of "
"the ``APDS9960_LED_DRIVE_*`` values."
msgstr ""
"Aseta läheisyyteen ja ALS:ään käytetty LED-virran voimakkuus. ``drive`` on "
