"``APDS9960_AGAIN_*`` -arvoista (0 = 1x, 1 = 4x, 2 = 16x, 3 = 64x)."

#: ../../library/omv.apds9960.rst:239
msgid ""
"Set the ambient-light-sensor gain. ``drive`` is one of the "
"``APDS9960_AGAIN_*`` values."
msgstr ""
"Aseta ympäristönvalosensorin vahvistus. ``drive`` on yksi "
